OL,3,ARAF apologises after jets flown low
OL,4,Aover Lockerbie near bombing anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Air Force has apologised to
OL,7,Fthe residents of Lockerbie after
OL,8,Fmilitary jets were flown over the area
OL,9,Fclose to the anniversary of the deadly
OL,10,Fbombing.
OL,12,FA Pan-Am jumbo jet came down over the
OL,13,FDumfries and Galloway town in December
OL,14,F1988, killing all 259 people on board
OL,15,Fand 11 people on the ground.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
