OL,3,ARAF apologises after jets flown low
OL,4,Aover Lockerbie near bombing anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal MP David Mundell said there was
OL,7,Fan understanding in place after the
OL,8,Fattack that there would not be low
OL,9,Fflying over the community out of
OL,10,Frespect to residents, but reports
OL,11,Fsuggest this was broken on several
OL,12,Foccasions earlier this month.
OL,14,FThe RAF said it was sorry for any
OL,15,Fdistress caused, and that it was
OL,16,Finvestigating.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
